  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">FA-Youth at risk project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program will strengthen the capacity and quality of what TSA DRC is already doing to provide training and job opportunities for out-of-school and unemployed vulnerable youth in and around Kinshasa. This will be achieved through increased cooperation between existing vocational training centers, standardization, accreditation of programs, increasing relevance of training through dialogue with the labor market, and increased cooperation and involvement of government authorities.</narrative>
  </description>
